	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino per Iesum Christum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Siehe oben <ref target="file11066">Nr. 1024</ref>.</note> superioribus diebus, dum essem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Isnę una cum charissimo nostro fratre <persName ref="p467">Butzero</persName>, atque literas per d[ominum] doctorem Zwickium <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad te deferri curabam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ubi vero <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName> meae, quas tibi destinaram, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>pervenissent litere, aberat <persName ref="p4079">Io[annes] Zwickius</persName>, quo factum est, ut invita prochrasti<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>natione ad te non pervenerint.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Interim diaconus nostrae <placeName ref="l320">Memmingensis</placeName> ecclesiae<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p6361">Hans Salb</persName>, 1532-1538 Helfer bei St. Martin in <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> (s. Hermann Erhard, Memminger Pfarrerbuch, Neustadt a. d. Aisch 1977, S. 17).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in domino cooperarius meus, <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName> abiturus pollicebatur et nomine meo <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>velle tuam humanitatem invisere, cui quoque literas dedi tibi deferendas.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Sed corporis aegritudine interceptus cogebatur relicto itinere <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>versus <placeName ref="l320">Memingam</placeName> remeare, ubi iam altera vice spe mea frustratus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed quia michi persuasi<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> persuasi <hi>gestrichenes</hi> per[...].</note> meas literas, quas ab <placeName ref="l234">Isna</placeName> scripsi, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ad tuas pervenisse manus, hortor per dominum, amice incomparabilis, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ut saltem uno verbo respondeas, ut, si quid animi sunt raritatis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>mucore obsiti atque non nichil superati, denuo a situ vindicati <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>foelicius coeant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ego de adventu meo (quem iam altera vice <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tentavi) nondum plane despondi animum, immo constitui te tuamque <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>familiam invisere.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Cogor tamen ob praesentem necessitatem moras nectere.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Uxor enim mea<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="3">[...], <persName ref="p19837">geb. Lübegger</persName> (vgl. <bibl source="b1">HBBW I</bibl> <ref target="file10071">[Nr. 43]</ref>, S. 222, Anm. 4).</note> graviter gestans uterum fere parturire incipit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>At<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>vor</hi> At <hi>verschmiertes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note> postquam fęliciter pepererit, accingam me itineri<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. auch unten <ref target="file11085">Nr. 1043</ref>, 36f, und 1058, 9f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ora dominum, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>mi frater, hos ut conatus meos suo spiritu provehat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>domino, charissime frater, et me pristino amore prosequere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nomine nostro dilectam tibi coniugem<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="5"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> atque matrem<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="6"><persName ref="p7042">Anna, geb. Wiederkehr</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p1753">Leonem Iude</persName> et <persName ref="p8127">Pelli<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>canum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Spiritus domini sit semper tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><pb type="edition" next="235"/>Datum 9. septembris, <placeName ref="l320">Memminge</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>anno 1537.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8440">Gervasius Sco<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>las<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ticus</persName><note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Über der Zeile von <persName ref="p2979">Simlers</persName> Hand:</hi> <persName ref="p8440">Gervasius Scolasticus</persName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Magnae pietatis et eruditionis viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ac domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesie antistiti vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>praeceptori ac fratri cum primis <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
